  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of human rights of people living with HIV/AIDS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDH has worked in Cochabamba since 1995, carrying out research into infection and the situation of people living with HIV/AIDS, and currently operates an integrated programme including prevention, training for health professionals, defence of the human rights of people living with HIV/AIDS (including educating them about their rights), and medical, social and psychological support for those infected. IDH carries out this work through a team of lawyers that push the government to comply with legislation passed on HIV prevention and also by raising awareness among the general public through events and workshops.</narrative>
  </description>
